WEBVTT

00:19.860 --> 00:22.946
‪AFTERNOON FURINKAN SHOW
‪BY THE BROADCASTING CLUB

00:23.030 --> 00:24.031
‪YOUR ANNOUNCER
‪ICHIRO

00:24.114 --> 00:26.491
‪It has been too long, everyone.

00:26.575 --> 00:29.911
‪I am your very own Ichiro
‪from the Furinkan Broadcast Club.

00:29.995 --> 00:30.996
‪OUR GUESTS

00:31.079 --> 00:32.080
‪HI, NICE TO MEET YOU

00:32.164 --> 00:34.750
‪We are coming to you
‪from this special broadcast set today.

00:34.833 --> 00:36.043
‪SCOOP!
‪SHOCKING PHOTOS AND SECRETS

00:36.126 --> 00:39.713
‪This candid photo caused
‪quite a stir last time.

00:40.213 --> 00:44.885
‪Out of fear, Ranma Saotome struggled
‪desperately to destroy the evidence.

00:44.968 --> 00:46.678
‪But how hopeless.

00:46.762 --> 00:51.057
‪The crucial negative was inside a collar
‪that attacks all with an electric shock.

00:52.392 --> 00:57.272
‪Meanwhile, Akane Tendo worked hard
‪to bake cookies for Ranma.

00:57.355 --> 01:01.943
‪Unfortunately, he was so distracted,
‪he did not even try a single bite.

01:03.612 --> 01:05.155
‪WILL THIS SHOW FEED US?

01:05.238 --> 01:08.825
‪But as expected of Akane Tendo,

01:08.909 --> 01:11.161
‪she caught on to Kodachi Kuno's scheme

01:11.244 --> 01:15.999
‪and began searching for clues
‪like a seasoned sleuth.

01:16.541 --> 01:21.129
‪Will Ranma Saotome be able to get
‪his hands on that negative?

01:21.213 --> 01:22.130
‪OBTAIN NEGATIVE

01:22.214 --> 01:27.052
‪Will Akane Tendo ever
‪get Ranma to eat her cookies?

01:27.135 --> 01:28.011
‪THEIR FATES ARE?

01:29.012 --> 01:31.097
‪Shall we keep our eyes wide open

01:31.181 --> 01:35.769
‪and watch what fate decides for these two?

01:39.231 --> 01:41.942
‪IT'S STARTING!

01:44.611 --> 01:47.948
‪RANMA1/2

03:12.657 --> 03:18.705
‪I ATE THE WHOLE THING

03:18.788 --> 03:20.081
<i>‪That stupid Ranma.</i>

03:20.165 --> 03:23.793
<i>‪Just what does Kodachi have on you?</i>

03:24.794 --> 03:27.547
<i>‪There should be a clue somewhere.</i>

03:51.905 --> 03:54.950
‪To enter my room without permission…

03:55.033 --> 03:58.119
‪What an ignorant woman
‪with no common sense!

04:02.374 --> 04:06.086
‪I never thought you'd be the one
‪lecturing me about common sense.

04:06.711 --> 04:07.963
‪Confess.

04:08.046 --> 04:10.173
‪What are you using
‪to blackmail Ranma with?

04:14.344 --> 04:16.221
‪How outlandish,
‪coming up with false accusations.

04:16.304 --> 04:17.806
‪My Ranma and I are already lovers.

04:17.889 --> 04:19.224
‪A SWEET MEMORY WITH MY RANMA

04:19.307 --> 04:20.892
‪What kind of nonsense is that?

04:21.810 --> 04:23.436
‪If you think I'm lying,

04:23.520 --> 04:25.522
‪then take a look behind you.

04:32.153 --> 04:35.031
‪My Ranma, I see you've returned.

04:35.740 --> 04:38.159
‪When did you make something like this?

04:38.827 --> 04:41.246
‪-What was that photo?
‪-Shut up.

04:45.792 --> 04:47.669
‪-Hey, Kodachi.
‪-Yes?

04:47.752 --> 04:50.839
‪I also want a copy of this photo
‪as a commemoration.

04:50.922 --> 04:54.050
‪My Ranma would also like one
‪to hang in your room?

04:54.801 --> 04:57.679
‪Yeah, sure. Kind of.

04:57.762 --> 04:59.139
‪Really?

05:00.098 --> 05:02.183
‪But, oh dear.

05:02.267 --> 05:04.853
<i>‪That collar the negative was hidden in…</i>

05:04.936 --> 05:07.188
‪MR. TURTLE

05:13.653 --> 05:14.654
‪It won't come off.

05:15.530 --> 05:18.742
<i>‪That belt is made</i>
<i>‪from a memory configuration alloy.</i>

05:18.825 --> 05:21.661
‪There is only one way to remove it
‪without getting shocked.

05:21.745 --> 05:23.371
‪Soaking it in hot water.

05:28.501 --> 05:30.795
‪Tatewaki-senpai!

05:31.713 --> 05:34.758
‪Let's take a bath together.

05:35.342 --> 05:36.718
<i>‪Together…</i>

05:37.802 --> 05:39.637
‪BATHE… TOGETHER

05:42.265 --> 05:43.725
‪Did…

05:43.808 --> 05:47.645
‪Did you say bathe together?

05:50.356 --> 05:52.192
‪You must not, pigtailed girl.

05:52.275 --> 05:54.903
‪You should respect yourself more!

05:54.986 --> 05:57.155
‪We should have

05:57.238 --> 05:59.324
‪a pure and upright,

05:59.407 --> 06:01.701
‪proper high school romance!

06:01.785 --> 06:02.786
‪BATHING ROOM

06:07.916 --> 06:11.044
‪I can't get my kimono off
‪because of this belt!

06:11.127 --> 06:12.420
‪Don't cry!

06:14.339 --> 06:15.924
‪By the way,

06:16.633 --> 06:19.719
‪have you ever shared a kiss

06:20.595 --> 06:21.679
‪with my Ranma?

06:30.230 --> 06:32.482
‪No, right? Never, right?

06:33.274 --> 06:34.359
‪Of course you haven't.

06:35.026 --> 06:36.611
‪Obviously not!

06:38.113 --> 06:40.073
‪And you have?

06:44.994 --> 06:46.621
‪Take a look at that.

06:56.381 --> 06:58.550
‪Tatewaki-senpai!

06:59.259 --> 07:02.303
‪Hurry up!

07:03.429 --> 07:05.557
‪To go into the bath fully dressed…

07:06.141 --> 07:10.103
‪I can't do something so senseless.

07:11.187 --> 07:13.606
‪Did you ever have any sense?

07:22.240 --> 07:24.826
‪All right, I'm taking it all off.

07:27.328 --> 07:29.038
‪Such an innocent seduction.

07:29.664 --> 07:31.416
‪What a cute girl.

07:31.499 --> 07:33.626
‪I'm coming right now, pigtailed girl!

07:33.710 --> 07:34.794
‪Oops.

07:43.470 --> 07:44.971
‪Yes! It's the negative!

07:46.139 --> 07:47.724
‪Hah, got you.

07:48.266 --> 07:50.852
‪Now come here, pigtailed girl.

07:50.935 --> 07:53.354
‪With this, I've got nothing to fear.

08:00.403 --> 08:01.446
‪What?

08:02.614 --> 08:05.950
‪You filthy playboy!

08:07.160 --> 08:09.954
‪Hey! What nonsense are you talking about?

08:15.877 --> 08:18.296
‪I am so sorry, my Ranma.

08:18.379 --> 08:20.715
‪It was a secret between the two of us,

08:20.798 --> 08:22.759
‪but I accidentally showed it off.

08:23.635 --> 08:24.844
‪It's a fake photo.

08:26.387 --> 08:28.389
‪What a crappy excuse.

08:28.932 --> 08:31.893
‪That's not what I mean. Look at this.

08:32.769 --> 08:33.978
‪See, this is--

08:34.062 --> 08:36.648
‪A picture of the moment before our kiss.

08:36.731 --> 08:39.150
‪What about that negative?

08:39.859 --> 08:43.655
‪Since we've been found out,
‪there is no more need to sneak around.

08:47.617 --> 08:51.788
‪Let us have a forthright and public kiss.

08:51.871 --> 08:54.290
‪No!

08:55.208 --> 08:56.292
‪That's cold!

08:57.252 --> 08:58.503
‪Where's my Ranma?

08:58.586 --> 09:01.005
‪Go ahead and do it. As much as you want.

09:02.340 --> 09:04.050
‪Oh, pigtailed girl!

09:04.592 --> 09:08.012
‪You! Where did you hide my Ranma?

09:08.096 --> 09:09.639
‪You philanderer!

09:09.722 --> 09:12.934
‪Akane! Hey! Let's talk--

09:14.602 --> 09:15.937
‪Take me with you and run away!

09:16.521 --> 09:18.815
‪Tatewaki-senpai, are you defending her?

09:20.692 --> 09:23.361
‪Who will you choose? Me or Akane?

09:32.495 --> 09:36.082
‪Akane Tendo.
‪My heart will forever love you!

09:36.708 --> 09:37.709
‪Stop right there!

09:37.792 --> 09:40.086
‪Come and get me!

09:40.670 --> 09:42.463
‪You coward!

09:50.263 --> 09:51.264
‪He got away.

09:52.557 --> 09:54.225
‪When I find you,

09:54.309 --> 09:56.894
‪you are so done for!

09:58.479 --> 10:01.149
<i>‪Forgive me, Akane Tendo.</i>

10:01.232 --> 10:04.819
<i>‪That stupid Akane.</i>
<i>‪Why won't she listen to me?</i>

10:21.586 --> 10:22.712
‪Okay.

10:25.548 --> 10:27.175
‪Sorry, Tatewaki-senpai.

10:31.054 --> 10:34.349
‪Where the hell is that dumb Ranma hiding?

10:34.432 --> 10:35.850
‪Here?

10:39.020 --> 10:40.271
‪Here?

10:41.731 --> 10:43.274
‪Accept your fate and come out.

10:47.111 --> 10:49.739
<i>‪I said the photo was a fake.</i>

10:50.531 --> 10:52.200
‪Akane is such a blockhead.

10:54.077 --> 10:57.080
‪Are you here? Here? Here?

10:58.206 --> 10:59.374
‪LAVATORY

11:04.962 --> 11:06.422
‪That Ranma…

11:07.048 --> 11:09.801
‪You won't get away from me.

11:14.972 --> 11:18.142
‪This is getting annoying. Just go home.

11:30.488 --> 11:32.615
‪Ranma!

11:35.535 --> 11:37.453
‪Got you!

11:48.756 --> 11:50.883
‪Good grief.

12:01.227 --> 12:03.229
‪What are you doing there?

12:04.605 --> 12:05.773
‪Who knows?

12:06.357 --> 12:08.151
‪Akane Tendo!

12:08.901 --> 12:10.778
‪I am sorry about earlier.

12:10.862 --> 12:13.239
‪You are the only one for me, after all.

12:17.368 --> 12:18.619
‪Need help?

12:20.663 --> 12:21.956
‪Who does?

12:22.999 --> 12:26.878
‪Akane Tendo…

12:30.214 --> 12:34.760
‪"I'm sorry for doubting you.
‪Please help me." Right?

12:36.179 --> 12:39.140
‪What? You're taking advantage
‪of this situation?

12:40.641 --> 12:41.642
‪Okay.

12:42.768 --> 12:44.854
‪Then, do it yourself,

12:44.937 --> 12:46.606
‪you muscle woman.

12:46.689 --> 12:49.233
<i>‪Muscle woman…</i>

12:50.234 --> 12:52.904
‪Who the hell would want your help--

12:58.826 --> 13:00.745
‪Hey, Akane.

13:00.828 --> 13:02.705
‪Wake up.

13:03.748 --> 13:05.416
‪You must not, my Ranma.

13:07.084 --> 13:10.588
‪If you force that mouse trap open,
‪you will receive an electric shock.

13:11.839 --> 13:14.425
‪I have the key for it.

13:14.509 --> 13:15.593
‪Key?

13:16.636 --> 13:17.720
‪Yes.

13:20.223 --> 13:25.728
‪I carelessly dropped the key
‪into one of these dishes I made.

13:33.611 --> 13:34.862
‪Okay.

13:41.619 --> 13:43.579
‪It's not poisoned.

13:52.964 --> 13:54.465
‪Is it delicious?

13:57.009 --> 14:01.097
‪Hey, Ranma. Why are you sitting there
‪eating like everything's okay?

14:01.180 --> 14:03.683
‪Shut up. Just wait.

14:04.934 --> 14:07.770
‪My, my, you have quite the appetite.

14:07.853 --> 14:11.941
‪I can't believe you are enjoying
‪my home cooking this much.

14:12.024 --> 14:15.486
‪I am incredibly happy.

14:20.366 --> 14:22.451
<i>‪When you didn't</i>

14:23.077 --> 14:27.081
<i>‪even eat my cookies!</i>

14:33.254 --> 14:34.630
<i>‪Found it. The key.</i>

14:38.968 --> 14:41.721
<i>‪Akane, I'll get you</i>
<i>‪out of there right now.</i>

14:42.930 --> 14:45.600
‪Sorry for being

14:45.683 --> 14:49.061
‪such a terrible cook!

14:54.650 --> 14:56.694
‪Hey!

14:56.777 --> 14:58.279
‪What?

15:05.077 --> 15:09.040
‪Being too jealous isn't cute at all,
‪you know?

15:10.249 --> 15:12.293
‪What kind of nonsense is that?

15:12.376 --> 15:14.378
‪Why would I be jealous?

15:15.254 --> 15:17.548
‪Then why are you so mad?

15:17.632 --> 15:20.551
‪It's none of your business
‪whose home-cooking I eat.

15:20.635 --> 15:22.178
‪Got a problem with that?

15:26.933 --> 15:28.726
‪Enough. I'm going home.

15:32.772 --> 15:34.941
<i>‪What? She backed down easily.</i>

15:43.366 --> 15:46.160
‪Just so you know,
‪I'm not the least bit jealous.

15:46.243 --> 15:47.244
‪BLUNT WEAPON

15:47.828 --> 15:49.163
‪You idiot!

15:49.246 --> 15:54.126
‪I'll never help a violent woman
‪like you again…

16:00.549 --> 16:03.761
‪The paralytic drug I put in the food

16:03.844 --> 16:05.846
‪is finally taking effect.

16:05.930 --> 16:07.682
‪Damn it.

16:07.765 --> 16:12.186
‪Now that the obstacle is gone, my Ranma,

16:12.269 --> 16:16.232
‪let's enjoy some private time together.

16:41.340 --> 16:44.385
<i>‪It's none of your business</i>
<i>‪whose home-cooking I eat.</i>

16:57.189 --> 16:58.190
‪Akane.

17:02.445 --> 17:04.947
‪Why do you look so depressed?

17:13.831 --> 17:14.832
‪Really?

17:15.666 --> 17:18.669
‪Ranma is such a scoundrel.

17:20.421 --> 17:22.590
‪But it doesn't matter anymore.

17:26.093 --> 17:29.638
‪Then should I sell this to Kuno?

17:31.891 --> 17:33.184
‪Go ahead.

17:33.267 --> 17:34.268
‪Akane.

17:37.104 --> 17:41.776
‪But wasn't Ranma being blackmailed?

17:42.359 --> 17:45.321
‪I bet that's why he ate her cooking.

17:46.322 --> 17:48.491
‪It's Kuno's sister we're talking about.

17:48.574 --> 17:50.201
‪That seems like something she'd do.

17:57.750 --> 17:58.793
‪It's okay.

18:00.211 --> 18:03.130
‪You worked so hard baking them.

18:03.756 --> 18:06.675
‪Let's make Ranma say they're delicious.

18:19.980 --> 18:21.899
‪Hey. Let me--

18:22.817 --> 18:24.610
‪You. What are you planning?

18:24.693 --> 18:26.737
‪All right, my Ranma.

18:27.321 --> 18:30.699
‪Let's turn that fake picture
‪into a real one.

18:32.076 --> 18:34.620
‪This isn't the time to joke. Hey!

18:36.038 --> 18:37.164
‪Fake?

18:37.748 --> 18:41.502
‪I see. So, Ranma was telling the truth.

18:46.465 --> 18:47.800
‪I can easily--

18:50.719 --> 18:53.681
‪Accept your fate and let us kiss.

18:56.892 --> 18:57.893
‪What?

19:01.772 --> 19:05.442
‪You should know when to give up.

19:15.286 --> 19:16.871
‪You…

19:19.290 --> 19:22.626
‪A kiss? Just try it, if you can.

19:26.172 --> 19:29.550
‪My Ranma. That chandelier is…

19:33.762 --> 19:35.055
‪dangerous.

19:40.853 --> 19:42.438
‪You…

19:44.982 --> 19:46.775
‪How handsome.

19:47.902 --> 19:50.905
‪My Ranma.

19:53.115 --> 19:54.575
‪Hot!

20:02.833 --> 20:04.418
‪You wicked fiend.

20:10.049 --> 20:11.425
‪My Ranma?

20:23.312 --> 20:24.730
‪A cookie.

20:31.737 --> 20:32.821
‪Hey.

20:39.286 --> 20:40.579
‪You left this behind.

20:43.249 --> 20:44.291
‪I don't need it.

20:45.668 --> 20:46.669
‪Really?

20:47.586 --> 20:50.005
‪Then I'll eat them all.

20:55.302 --> 20:56.512
‪That's okay, right?

21:02.059 --> 21:03.060
‪Yeah.

21:10.109 --> 21:12.528
‪Ranma said he's not feeling well.

21:12.611 --> 21:14.405
‪I wonder why.

21:14.488 --> 21:15.990
‪You knew this would happen.

21:17.199 --> 21:18.993
‪But you still ate them.

21:23.706 --> 21:26.792
‪That's weird. I worked hard baking them.

22:57.007 --> 23:02.012
‪Subtitle translation by: Annie Chen
‪Production Supervisor: Ranma1/2 Project
